<MECA ID = "T030082A100A933" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "18Aug2005"     MECATYPE = "GENERAL" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Compact Compound Clutch Piston</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>A 2-piece pull type piston has been adopted for the clutch piston that operates the No.2 clutch (C2), making the compound clutch more compact.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>To reduce drag loss of the friction material caused by looseness of the 2-piece piston, pull piston No.1 is a piston with a spring mechanism. This achieves both compactness and high efficiency.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a3810108p" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "4.042in" />
</FIGURE>
</MECA>

<MECA ID = "T030082A100A935" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "18Aug2005"     MECATYPE = "GENERAL" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Angular Ball Bearings Supporting the Counter Gear</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Double-row angular ball bearings have been adopted to support the counter drive gear and the Ravigneaux type planetary gear unit, achieving higher efficiency through reduced friction and improved quietness.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a3810110p" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "3.431in" />
</FIGURE>
</MECA>

<MECA ID = "T030082A100A936" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "18Aug2005"     MECATYPE = "GENERAL" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Low-loss Friction Material</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>A new groove shape has been adopted for the clutches and brakes, providing drag suited to the operating environment, greatly reducing drag loss and achieving high efficiency.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a3810111p" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "2.847in" />
</FIGURE>
</MECA>
</PARA>
</SECTION>